A change that alters a contract, API, or data flow is **one delivery unit**: implementation + tests + SSOT architecture docs in the **same commit**. A follow-up docs commit is a process failure, not cleanup. If a doc file has foreign dirty hunks — take only this change’s lines; do not ship code without docs. Details: `.cursor/rules/git-workflow.mdc`, `.cursor/rules/update-architecture-docs.mdc`.
